  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“Nature is dangerous. Everything in it wants to kill you, so why not take advantage of that?”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Wood blast</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can select laced infusion, sickening infusion, and psychotropic infusion in addition to the substance infusions you normally have access too, being able to apply them to your wood blast and its composites. If you use any of these infusions with the nightshade composite blast, increase the DC of your blast by 1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc54\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
